			"Message": "refactor(Project): Synchronize Element submodule across 3 components\n\nCoordinate Element update bringing Cocoon, Mountain, and Sky to latest state:\n- Cocoon: Add Wave 7 instrumentation to $deltaExtensions handler with logging for added/removed counts, registry size, activation events, and wall-clock duration. Fix ISerializationResult/IDeserializationResult interfaces for TypeScript's exactOptionalPropertyTypes\n- Mountain: Split monolithic WindServiceHandlers.rs and CocoonService/mod.rs into domain modules (Commands, Configuration, Extensions, FileSystem, Model, NativeHost, Navigation, Output, Search, Storage, Terminal, UI, Utilities for Wind; Auth, Command, Debug, Extension, FileSystem, Initialization, Output, Provider, Save, SCM, Secret, Task, Terminal, TreeView, Window, Workspace for Cocoon)\n- Sky: Add ExtensionChangeSubscriber listening to Mountain's sky://extensions/installed and sky://extensions/uninstalled events, forwarding to VS Code's ExtensionEnablementService for live sidebar updates without workbench reload\n\nThis completes the K2/K3 milestone for live extension state synchronization between Mountain and Wind/Sky frontend.",
