			],
			"Message": "refactor(Project): Synchronize Element submodule across 5 components\n\nCoordinate submodule update bringing Cocoon, Common, Mountain, Sky, and Wind to latest state:\n- Cocoon: Split monolithic Message.ts and WorkspaceNamespace.ts into modular directories with separate modules for Types, Constants, VSBuffer, Validation, Serialization, Batching, and domain-specific namespaces\n- Common: Add 9 new IPC channels to Channel registry — QuickInput (showInputBox, showQuickPick), TextFile (read, write, save), and WorkingCopy (getAllDirty, getDirtyCount, isDirty, setDirty) — completing IPC contract for text editor and quick input services\n- Mountain: Add WindServiceHandlers for IPC bridge and CreateEffectForRequest effect creators across 20+ domain modules (Authentication, Clipboard, Commands, Configuration, Diagnostics, Documents, FileSystem, Git, Keybinding, Languages, NativeHost, SCM, Search, Secrets, StatusBar, Storage, Task, Terminal, TreeView, UserInterface, Webview, WindowUI, Workspace)\n- Sky: Minor dependency bumps (pnpm/action-setup 6.0.1→6.0.3, @xterm/xterm 6.1.0-beta.197→6.1.0-beta.199)\n- Wind: Migrate all 19 service Live layers to use typed Channel registry imports instead of free-text string literals, ensuring compile-time validation\n\nThis establishes a robust typed IPC surface between Wind frontend and Mountain backend with compile-time validated channel references across all service layers.",
			"SHA": "05e609c9fc4c30f2dd7fc534ab677de7dc810b1b"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-21T23:43:59Z",
			"File": [
				"⡟⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				96,
				14
			],
			"Message": "build(Land): Implement tier-gated implementation selection system\n\nAdd a comprehensive tier-gating architecture (Atom I5/I7/N2/N3/N4/J1/J4/J4b) enabling build-time selection of implementation paths across all Elements:\n\n- Add `.env.Land.Sample` with 17 tier-gated capabilities (TierFileSystem, TierGlob, TierRemoteProcedureCall, etc.) and product identity vars\n- Add `Maintain/Script/TierEnvironment.sh` to fan-out tier/product/network env vars to Cargo features, Cocoon ESBuild define blob, and Sky Vite\n- Add `Maintain/Script/ResolveProductConfig.sh` to merge Product* vars into Sky/Public/product.json\n- Add `Maintain/Script/ProfileMarker.sh` for Output cache cleanup on profile flip\n- Add `Maintain/Integration/SmokeProfiles.sh` for profile smoke testing (Atom N4)\n- Extend Debug/Release build scripts with 8 new profiles: debug-electron-minimal, debug-mountain-only, debug-cocoon-headless, debug-kernel, release-electron-minimal, release-mountain-only, release-cocoon-headless, release-kernel\n- Add new Cargo dependencies: arboard (clipboard), open (external URLs)\n- Document workflow in Documentation/GitHub/Workflow/TierGatedImplementationSelection.md\n\nElement submodule synchronizes Mountain (native file watcher, workspace management, .env.Land bootstrap, zombie-Cocoon prevention), Wind (dialog bridge, Tier.ts), Sky (Tier* injection, LAND_ENABLE_WIND), and Common (FileWatcherProvider trait).",
